      "notes": [
        {
          "text": "The document is titled 'Proposed SOR w.e.f. 20.01.2023, escalated @ 0.65% w.e.f. 01.05.2026' and is published on the port's Tariffs page; its escalated rates are entered for 1 May 2026 to 30 April 2027.",
          "source": {
            "document": "sor-escalated-2026-27",
            "page": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "The 2024 pilotage corrigendum corrected the Vadinar 'above 60,000 GRT' rows to read 'over 60000 GRT'; the escalated 2026 table already prints 'over 60000 GRT'.",
          "source": {
            "document": "pilotage-corrigendum-2024",
            "page": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Berth hire is entered for Kandla's non-crane general cargo and liquid cargo berths. Crane berths are charged at 200% when the port's shore cranes are used. Kandla stream mooring charges are for ships at moorings, not at berths, and are not entered.",
          "source": {
            "document": "sor-escalated-2026-27",
            "page": 11
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "If a ship calls at more than one of Kandla, Tuna and Vadinar on one visit, port dues are charged once at the highest applicable rate (note 10).",
          "source": {
            "document": "sor-escalated-2026-27",
            "page": 6
          }
        }
